    "title": "Founders' Favourites - Natural Zero Waste Personal Care Gift Set",
    "body_text": "Some gifts are curated. This one is lived in.\n\nFounders' Favourites is Sahar Mansoor's personal edit — the four products she reaches for every single day, whether she's powering through a yoga session, sitting in an investor meeting or winding down at the end of a long one. Not chosen for the packaging. Chosen because they genuinely work.\n\nThis is a gift that says something — about what you value, about the person you're giving it to, and about choosing products that are as good for the planet as they are for your skin.\n\nWhat's inside:\n\nSunset Waves Spa Bar (100g) A premium handmade cold-processed soap bar with French red and pink clays, lavender, rose and honeysuckle. Nominated for Grazia's Best Soap. Rich, aromatic and genuinely mood-lifting — the kind of soap that turns an ordinary shower into a ritual. \"Smells absolutely divine — my go-to for an instant mood lift.\"\n\nRound the Clock Solid Deodorant (15g) A layered woody natural solid deodorant — opens crisp, settles warm — that delivers genuine all-day odour control without aluminium, without baking soda and without compromise. Taken from yoga to investor meetings and everywhere in between. \"Fresh, reliable and all-natural — it's seen me through everything.\"\n\nRainforest Moisturiser (20g) A rich plant-based body moisturiser with jojoba, sunflower, grapeseed and apricot oils, finished with sweet orange and vanilla. Deeply nourishing without grease, and genuinely lovely to use. \"Feels like a little treat every time.\"\n\nBusy Bee Lip Balm (10g) A 100% natural lip balm with coconut oil, shea butter and a protective natural wax — the handbag essential that keeps lips soft through every season. Better than petroleum jelly. Longer lasting than anything in a plastic tube. \"My everyday essential — always in my bag.\"\n\nPerfect for: Corporate gifting, employee appreciation, client gifts, Women's Day, Diwali, birthdays, festive occasions and anyone who deserves something personal, sustainable and genuinely useful.\n\nPlastic-free, made in India and genuinely good for you — because the best gifts are the ones people actually use.\n\nMade in India\n\nStarting from. MRP: Rs. 1500-1600/- inclusive of all taxes",
