    "body_html": "<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Some gifts are curated. This one is lived in.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Founders' Favourites</strong> is Sahar Mansoor's personal edit — the four products she reaches for every single day, whether she's powering through a yoga session, sitting in an investor meeting or winding down at the end of a long one. Not chosen for the packaging. Chosen because they genuinely work.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">This is a gift that says something — about what you value, about the person you're giving it to, and about choosing products that are as good for the planet as they are for your skin.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>What's inside:</strong></p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><a href=\"https://barenecessities.in/collections/handcrafted-soaps/products/sunset-waves-lavender-rose-handcrafted-soap-cold-processed-natural?variant=47570105073910\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"SUNSET WAVES HANDCRAFTED COLD PROCESSED SOAP BAR\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Sunset Waves Spa Bar (100g)</strong> </a>A premium handmade cold-processed soap bar with French red and pink clays, lavender, rose and honeysuckle. Nominated for Grazia's Best Soap. Rich, aromatic and genuinely mood-lifting — the kind of soap that turns an ordinary shower into a ritual. <em>\"Smells absolutely divine — my go-to for an instant mood lift.\"</em></p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><a href=\"https://barenecessities.in/collections/deodorants/products/round-the-clock-deodorant-earth-friendly-plant-based-vegan-plastic-free-solid-perfume?variant=47024525345014\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"round the clock natural solid deodorant aluminium free and baking soda free\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Round the Clock Solid Deodorant (15g)</strong></a> A layered woody natural solid deodorant — opens crisp, settles warm — that delivers genuine all-day odour control without aluminium, without baking soda and without compromise. Taken from yoga to investor meetings and everywhere in between. <em>\"Fresh, reliable and all-natural — it's seen me through everything.\"</em></p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><a href=\"https://barenecessities.in/collections/hydrating-moisturizers/products/rainforest-deep-hydration-vegan-moisturizer-natural-dry-skin?variant=45659098841334\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"rainforest deep hydrating face and body moisturiser\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Rainforest Moisturiser (20g)</strong> </a>A rich plant-based body moisturiser with jojoba, sunflower, grapeseed and apricot oils, finished with sweet orange and vanilla. Deeply nourishing without grease, and genuinely lovely to use. <em>\"Feels like a little treat every time.\"</em></p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><a href=\"https://barenecessities.in/collections/all-products/products/busy-bee-lip-balm-zero-waste-eco-friendly-natural\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"busy bee natural lip balm for hydration\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Busy Bee Lip Balm (10g)</strong></a> A 100% natural lip balm with coconut oil, shea butter and a protective natural wax — the handbag essential that keeps lips soft through every season. Better than petroleum jelly. Longer lasting than anything in a plastic tube. <em>\"My everyday essential — always in my bag.\"</em></p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Perfect for:</strong> Corporate gifting, employee appreciation, client gifts, Women's Day, Diwali, birthdays, festive occasions and anyone who deserves something personal, sustainable and genuinely useful.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\">Plastic-free, made in India and genuinely good for you — because the best gifts are the ones people actually use.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1465\">Made in India</p>\n<p data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1533\"><strong data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1531\">Starting from. MRP: Rs. 1500-1600/- inclusive of all taxes </strong></p>",
